{"problem_id":"de6bf611-902c-4952-b81c-e25323375982","source_problem_id":"508951","normalized_content":{"assets":[{"alt":"","url":"/assets/fbb25b0d-5cff-4f71-aacf-54c03cc1c2c1","kind":"ordinary_image","asset_id":"fbb25b0d-5cff-4f71-aacf-54c03cc1c2c1","asset_key":"image_1"}],"format":"teacherhelper-normalized","sections":[{"key":"condition","html":"<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"fbb25b0d-5cff-4f71-aacf-54c03cc1c2c1\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" src=\"/assets/fbb25b0d-5cff-4f71-aacf-54c03cc1c2c1\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+a\"></span>. Най­ди­те <span data-inline-latex=\"f(-12)\"></span> .</p>","title":"Условие","asset_keys":["image_1"],"section_id":"condition:1"},{"key":"answer","html":"<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">0,75</span></p>","title":"Ответ","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"answer:1"},{"key":"solution","html":"<p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>y</i>  =  1, зна­чит, <i>a</i>  =  1. По гра­фи­ку <i>f</i>(3)  =  2, тогда  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{k}{3}+1=2\\iff k=3\"></span>.  Таким об­ра­зом, </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(-12)=\\frac{3}{-12}+1=-\\frac{1}{4}+1=\\frac{3}{4}=0{,}75\"></span>. </p></center>","title":"Решение","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"solution:1"}],"schema_version":3,"problem_reference_ids":{"prototype_problem_id":null,"group_parent_problem_id":null,"adjacent_group_parent_problem_id":null}}}
